      "id": "claim_b139a3a7659946eabf1a1cc6b53ca962",
      "statement": "Galpi is a local-first Apple Silicon macOS desktop app that records Korean meetings, transcribes them locally with speaker diarization, and optionally generates AI meeting minutes via an OpenAI-compatible API; one codebase spans a TypeScript webview frontend (src/), a Rust Tauri host (src-tauri/), and a bundled Python worker sidecar (worker/galpi_worker) offering a Qwen3 default preset and a legacy WhisperX preset.",
